        <rule name="Repair" id="8b1b-bda2-a058-970d" hidden="false">
          <description>If a Rhino is Immobilised then in susequent turns it may attempt to repair itself instead of shooting.  Roll a D6 in the Shooting phase.  On a roll of a 6+ the vehicle is no longer immobilized.</description>
